Notices for third-party data referenced by this repository.

cda_simthesis does **not** vendor Boston or MyConnectome CSVs. Boston Set A
fixtures are downloaded on demand from the public
[causal-open-data](https://github.com/kelvinlim/causal-open-data) repository
at a pinned commit (see `scripts/boston_fixtures_pin.json` and
`scripts/fetch_boston_fixtures.py`).

No Human Connectome Project (HCP) participant data, no other restricted
participant-level data, and no Jang panic-EMA files are stored here.

